// Test: Evidence marker Reported (~) basic usage
// Spec: 03-TYPES.md § 2.1 Evidence Markers
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that the Reported (~) evidence marker can be applied to
// basic types and that values with Reported evidence can be constructed
// and used.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should compile and run successfully, printing 77

rite main() {
    ≔ x: ~i32 = 77;
    println(x);
}
